"first issues</a> and making a tangible impact."
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງທັກສະຂອງທ່ານໂດຍການແກ້ໄຂ <a href=\"%(issues)s\">ບັນຫາເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ດີ</a> ຂອງພວກເຮົາ "
"ແລະ ສ້າງຜົນກະທົບທີ່ເຫັນໄດ້ຊັດເຈນ."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Browse the <a href=\"%(issues)s\">open issues</a> to gain insight into what "
"we are looking for."
msgstr "ເບິ່ງ <a href=\"%(issues)s\">ບັນຫາທີ່ເປີດຢູ່</a> ເພື່ອເບິ່ງວ່າພວກເຮົາກຳລັງຊອກຫາຫຍັງ."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Grab one of the <a href=\"%(issues)s\">good first issues</a> to show us your "
"expertise."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກ <a href=\"%(issues)s\">ບັນຫາເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ດີ</a> "
"ເພື່ອສະແດງຄວາມຊ່ຽວຊານຂອງທ່ານໃຫ້ພວກເຮົາເຫັນ."

msgid "Contribute to Weblate"
msgstr "ປະກອບສ່ວນກັບ Weblate"

msgid "Weblate is developed by an open community."
msgstr "Weblate ຖືກພັດທະນາໂດຍຊຸມຊົນເປີດ."

msgid ""
"There are many ways you can contribute to Weblate development. Talk about it "
"with your associates."
msgstr ""
"ມີຫຼາຍວິທີທີ່ທ່ານສາມາດປະກອບສ່ວນເຂົ້າໃນການພັດທະນາ Weblate. "
"ເວົ້າລົມກ່ຽວກັບມັນກັບເພື່ອນຮ່ວມງານຂອງທ່ານ."

msgid "View sources"
msgstr "ເບິ່ງຊອດໂຄ້ດ"

msgid "Translate the app"
msgstr "ແປພາສາແອັບ"

msgid "Found a <strong>bug</strong> in Weblate?"
msgstr "ພົບ <strong>ບັກ</strong> ໃນ Weblate ບໍ?"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"In case it is sensitive or a <strong>security issue</strong>, please report "
"it to %(report)s. Other ways of reporting security issue can be found in the "
"<a href=\"%(url)s\">documentation</a>."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າມັນເປັນເລື່ອງລະອຽດອ່ອນ ຫຼື <strong>ບັນຫາດ້ານຄວາມປອດໄພ</strong>, ກະລຸນາລາຍງານໄປທີ່ "
"%(report)s. ວິທີອື່ນໃນການລາຍງານບັນຫາຄວາມປອດໄພສາມາດພົບໄດ້ໃນ <a "
"href=\"%(url)s\">ເອກະສານ</a>."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"<strong>Ensure the bug is not already reported</strong>, by searching "
"through the <a href=\"%(url)s\">GitHub issues</a>."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າບັກນັ້ນຍັງບໍ່ຖືກລາຍງານ</strong>, ໂດຍການຄົ້ນຫາຜ່ານ <a "
"href=\"%(url)s\">GitHub issues</a>."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"If you're unable to find an open issue addressing the problem, <a "
"href=\"%(url)s\">open a new one</a>."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານບໍ່ພົບບັນຫາທີ່ເປີດຢູ່ນັ້ນແກ້ໄຂບັນຫານີ້ໄດ້, <a href=\"%(url)s\">ເປີດບັກໃໝ່</a>."

msgid ""
"<strong>Follow instructions in the issue template</strong>, and provide as "
"much relevant info as possible."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ປະຕິບັດຕາມຄຳແນະນຳໃນເທມເພລດຂອງບັນຫາ</strong>, ແລະ "
"ໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງຫຼາຍເທົ່າທີ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້."

msgid "GitHub issues"
msgstr "ລາຍງານບັນຫາໃນ GitHub"

msgid "Have a <strong>patch</strong> that fixes a bug?"
msgstr "ມີ <strong>patch</strong> ທີ່ແກ້ໄຂບັກບໍ?"

#, python-format
msgid "Open a new <a href=\"%(url)s\">GitHub pull request</a> with the patch."
msgstr "ເປີດ <a href=\"%(url)s\">GitHub pull request</a> ໃໝ່ພ້ອມກັບ patch."

msgid ""
"Ensure the pull request description clearly describes the problem and "
"solution. Include the relevant issue number if applicable."
msgstr ""
"ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າລາຍລະອຽດຂອງ pull request ອະທິບາຍບັນຫາ ແລະ ວິທີແກ້ໄຂຢ່າງຊັດເຈນ. "
"ໃສ່ເລກບັນຫາທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງຖ້າມີ."

msgid "Open a pull request"
msgstr "ເປີດ pull request"

msgid "Missing a <strong>feature</strong> or want to change something?"
msgstr "ຂາດ <strong>ຄຸນສົມບັດ</strong> ບາງຢ່າງ ຫຼື ຕ້ອງການປ່ຽນແປງຫຍັງບໍ?"

#, python-format
msgid "Suggest your change in the <a href=\"%(url)s\">GitHub issues</a>."
msgstr "ແນະນຳການປ່ຽນແປງຂອງທ່ານໃນ <a href=\"%(url)s\">GitHub issues</a>."

msgid "<strong>Source code</strong> related questions?"
msgstr "ມີຄຳຖາມກ່ຽວກັບ <strong>ຊອດໂຄ້ດ</strong> ບໍ?"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Please consult the <a href=\"%(url)s\">contributor documentation</a> to find "
"the most common topics."
msgstr ""
"ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງ <a href=\"%(url)s\">ເອກະສານສຳລັບຜູ້ປະກອບສ່ວນ</a> ເພື່ອຊອກຫາຫົວຂໍ້ທີ່ພົບເລື້ອຍ."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Share what is on your mind in the <a href=\"%(url)s\">GitHub discussions</a>."
msgstr "ແບ່ງປັນສິ່ງທີ່ທ່ານຄິດໃນ <a href=\"%(url)s\">GitHub discussions</a>."

msgid "Browse documentation"
msgstr "ເບິ່ງເອກະສານ"

msgid "Want to help out with <strong>Documentation</strong>?"
msgstr "ຕ້ອງການຊ່ວຍເລື່ອງ <strong>ເອກະສານ</strong> ບໍ?"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"The documentation is part of the main source code repository and you can "
"easily follow the links to edit each page directly from the <a "
"href=\"%(url)s\">documentation</a>."
msgstr ""
"ເອກະສານເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງ repository ຊອດໂຄ້ດຫຼັກ ແລະ "
"ທ່ານສາມາດຕິດຕາມລິ້ງເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂແຕ່ລະໜ້າໄດ້ໂດຍກົງຈາກ <a href=\"%(url)s\">ເອກະສານ</a>."

msgid ""
"Once you have a patch ready, please follow <a href=\"#patch\">patch "
"submission</a> instructions."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອທ່ານມີ patch ພ້ອມ, ກະລຸນາປະຕິບັດຕາມຄຳແນະນຳ <a href=\"#patch\">ການສົ່ງ patch</a>."

msgid ""
"Help fix and suggest non-code related pull-requests by joining the reviewer "
"team."
msgstr "ຊ່ວຍແກ້ໄຂ ແລະ ແນະນຳ pull-requests ທີ່ບໍ່ກ່ຽວກັບໂຄ້ດໂດຍການເຂົ້າຮ່ວມທີມຜູ້ກວດສອບ."

msgid "<strong>Financial support</strong> is always put to good use."
msgstr "<strong>ການສະໜັບສະໜູນທາງການເງິນ</strong> ຖືກນຳໄປໃຊ້ໃຫ້ເກີດປະໂຫຍດສະເໝີ."

msgid "Please open the donation page for options on how to donate."
msgstr "ກະລຸນາເປີດໜ້າບໍລິຈາກສຳລັບຕົວເລືອກວິທີການບໍລິຈາກ."

msgid "Donate now"
msgstr "ບໍລິຈາກດຽວນີ້"

msgid "<strong>Are you a translator?</strong> Help translate Weblate itself."
msgstr "<strong>ທ່ານແມ່ນນັກແປບໍ?</strong> ຊ່ວຍແປ Weblate ເອງ."

msgid ""
"You can translate Weblate and many other projects at <a href=\"https://"
"hosted.weblate.org/engage/weblate/\">hosted.weblate.org</a>."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດແປ Weblate ແລະ ໂປຣເຈັກອື່ນໆອີກຫຼາຍຢ່າງໄດ້ທີ່ <a href=\"https://"
"hosted.weblate.org/engage/weblate/\">hosted.weblate.org</a>."

msgid "Start translating"
msgstr "ເລີ່ມແປພາສາ"

msgid "Translation status"
msgstr "ສະຖານະການແປ"

msgid "Discover Weblate"
msgstr "ຄົ້ນພົບ Weblate"

msgid ""
"Check out who’s using Weblate already. We are a community of translators and "
"localization specialists who use and improve our common tool to empower "
"readers and app users around the World. Find your favorite projects and "
"start contributing together with us."
msgstr ""
"ເບິ່ງວ່າໃຜກຳລັງໃຊ້ Weblate ຢູ່. ພວກເຂົາແມ່ນຊຸມຊົນນັກແປ ແລະ ຜູ້ຊ່ຽວຊານດ້ານການປັບແຕ່ງພາສາ ທີ່ໃຊ້ "
"ແລະ ພັດທະນາເຄື່ອງມືຮ່ວມກັນເພື່ອຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຜູ້ອ່ານ ແລະ ຜູ້ໃຊ້ແອັບທົ່ວໂລກ. ຊອກຫາໂຄງການທີ່ເຈົ້າມັກ ແລະ "
"ເລີ່ມປະກອບສ່ວນຮ່ວມກັບພວກເຂົາ."

msgid "Add yours"
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຂອງທ່ານ"

msgid "project name"
msgstr "ຊື່ໂຄງການ"

#, python-format
msgid "%(count)s project"
msgid_plural "%(count)s projects"
msgstr[0] "%(count)s ໂຄງການ"

#, python-format
msgid "%(count)s translator"
msgid_plural "%(count)s translators"
msgstr[0] "%(count)s ນັກແປ"

#, python-format
msgid "…and %(count)s more"
msgid_plural "…and %(count)s more"
msgstr[0] "…ແລະ ອີກ %(count)s"

msgid "Customize listing"
msgstr "ປັບແຕ່ງລາຍການ"

msgid "No servers matched your search."
msgstr "ບໍ່ມີເຊີບເວີໃດກົງກັບການຄົ້ນຫາຂອງເຈົ້າ."

msgid "Weblate SSO"
msgstr "Weblate SSO"

msgid "You're being redirected to a SSO sign-in page."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າກຳລັງຖືກນຳທາງໄປໜ້າເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ SSO."

msgid ""
"Please click the button below if you're not redirected automatically within "
"a few seconds."
msgstr "ກະລຸນາກົດປຸ່ມດ້ານລຸ່ມຖ້າເຈົ້າບໍ່ຖືກນຳທາງໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດພາຍໃນສອງສາມວິນາທີ."

msgid "Sign in"
msgstr "ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ"

msgid "FOSDEM donation"
msgstr "ການບໍລິຈາກ FOSDEM"

msgid "Want to get a t-shirt or hoodie at our FOSDEM stand?"
msgstr "ຢາກໄດ້ເສື້ອຢືດ ຫຼື ເສື້ອກັນໜາວຢູ່ບູດ FOSDEM ຂອງພວກເຮົາບໍ່?"

msgid "Donate to get a t-shirt"
msgstr "ບໍລິຈາກເພື່ອຮັບເສື້ອຢືດ"

msgid "Donate to get a hoodie"
msgstr "ບໍລິຈາກເພື່ອຮັບເສື້ອກັນໜາວ"

msgid "Become a Weblate supporter"
msgstr "ມາເປັນຜູ້ສະໜັບສະໜູນ Weblate"

msgid ""
"Weblate does not require payment, and welcomes donations. There are many "
"ways to contribute. Discuss it with your associates."
msgstr ""
"Weblate ບໍ່ຮຽກຮ້ອງການຊຳລະເງິນ ແລະ ຍິນດີຮັບການບໍລິຈາກ. ມີຫຼາຍວິທີໃນການປະກອບສ່ວນ. "
"ປຶກສາຫາລືກັບເພື່ອນຮ່ວມງານຂອງເຈົ້າ."

msgid "Purchase premium cloud"
msgstr "ຊື້ພຣີມຽມຄລາວ"

msgid "Manage your donations"
msgstr "ຈັດການການບໍລິຈາກຂອງເຈົ້າ"

msgid "Recurring support and rewards"
msgstr "ການສະໜັບສະໜູນແບບຕໍ່ເນື່ອງ ແລະ ລາງວັນ"

msgid ""
"Recurring donations facilitate sustainable Weblate development, and even the "
"smallest amount is put to good use. Repeated appreciation helps in keeping "
"the project sustainable long term. Please consider this option if you are "
"hosting Weblate yourself without a support contract."
msgstr ""
"ການບໍລິຈາກແບບຕໍ່ເນື່ອງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການພັດທະນາ Weblate ຍືນຍົງ, ແລະ "
"ເຖິງແມ່ນຈຳນວນເງິນນ້ອຍໆກໍຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃຫ້ເກີດປະໂຫຍດ. "
"ການສະແດງຄວາມຂອບໃຈຊ້ຳໆຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ໂຄງການຍືນຍົງໃນໄລຍະຍາວ. ກະລຸນາພິຈາລະນາທາງເລືອກນີ້ ຖ້າເຈົ້າໂຮສ "
"Weblate ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໂດຍບໍ່ມີສັນຍາສະໜັບສະໜູນ."

msgid "Choose your reward"
msgstr "ເລືອກລາງວັນຂອງເຈົ້າ"

msgid "annually"
msgstr "ຕໍ່ປີ"

msgid "Donate"
msgstr "ບໍລິຈາກ"

msgid "Weblate heroism"
msgstr "ວິລະຊົນ Weblate"

msgid ""
"Commercial services like hosting or support for self-hosted installations "
"help fund Weblate development."
msgstr ""
"ບໍລິການທາງການຄ້າເຊັ່ນ: ການໂຮສ ຫຼື ການສະໜັບສະໜູນສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທຶນແກ່ການພັດທະນາ "
"Weblate."

msgid "Get help from Weblate"
msgstr "ຮັບຄວາມຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອຈາກ Weblate"

msgid "Single appreciative donation"
msgstr "ບໍລິຈາກເພື່ອຄວາມຊື່ນຊົມເທື່ອດຽວ"

msgid ""
"One-time donations are a great way to bring attention to a single issue "
"before or after it is fixed."
msgstr "ການບໍລິຈາກເທື່ອດຽວເປັນວິທີທີ່ດີໃນການດຶງດູດຄວາມສົນໃຈຕໍ່ບັນຫາໃດໜຶ່ງ ກ່ອນ ຫຼື ຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ມັນຖືກແກ້ໄຂ."

msgid "Weblate swag"
msgstr "ຂອງທີ່ລະນຶກ Weblate"

msgid ""
"Buying branded clothing and merch is a great way to support Weblate and show "
